# Cursor & Windsurf AI Rules for Personal Finance Dashboard

You are working on Manthan Ank's Personal Finance & Budget Dashboard built with Next.js 15, Recharts, and Supabase.

## Guidelines
- Write strict TypeScript code with explicit types from `@/lib/types`.
- All financial calculations must format currency using `formatCurrency(amount)` from `@/lib/utils`.
- Visualizations must use `<ResponsiveContainer width="100%" height="...">` to guarantee responsiveness on mobile, tablet, and desktop.
- Recharts components must be mounted only after client hydration (`isMounted` check) to prevent hydration mismatches.
- Ensure all forms have client-side validation and responsive touch targets (`min-h-[44px]`).

